# Cloudflare Pages: the demo is a single-page app at /, the docs (apps/docs) live under /docs.
# Every client-side route of apps/web (and /about-demo) is rewritten to the app shell. The rules
# list the routes explicitly instead of a catch-all `/* / 200`, so /docs/*, /assets/*,
# /demo-sw.js and the seed snapshot are never rewritten. scripts/site.test.ts fails when a new
# top-level route in apps/web is missing here. The target is `/`, not `/index.html`: Pages answers
# a rewrite to `/index.html` with a 308 to `/` (clean URLs), which loses the deep link.
